## Custom JSON Encoder/Decoder

### Default Encoder Limitation

Fiber v2.32.0+ uses `encoding/json` for stability, but it's **slower** than alternatives.

### Recommended Fast Encoders

```go
import (
    "github.com/gofiber/fiber/v2"
    json "github.com/goccy/go-json" // or other fast library
)

app := fiber.New(fiber.Config{
    JSONEncoder: json.Marshal,
    JSONDecoder: json.Unmarshal,
})
```

### Encoder Options

| Library | Speed | Compatibility | Use Case |
|---------|-------|---------------|----------|
| `goccy/go-json` | ⚡⚡⚡ | ✅ Excellent | **Recommended** - Best balance |
| `bytedance/sonic` | ⚡⚡⚡⚡ | ✅ Good | Fastest (JIT), x86 only |
| `segmentio/encoding` | ⚡⚡⚡ | ✅ Excellent | Wide type support |
| `mailru/easyjson` | ⚡⚡⚡ | ⚠️ Code gen | Requires code generation |
| `wI2L/jettison` | ⚡⚡⚡ | ✅ Good | Optimized for encoding |

### HTTP Client Custom Encoder

```go
client := fiber.AcquireClient()
client.JSONEncoder = json.Marshal
client.JSONDecoder = json.Unmarshal
```

